request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true.

governor turn 1: plan -> types, commands  (The request says "completed field", but Todo has no such field. The `complete` command sets `Todo.done` to true, so I'm treating that as the field meant. Plan: types adds a `{kind:"clear"}` Command variant. commands adds a pure clear() and wires it into parseArgs and run. storage and format don't need to change.)
round 1: owners types=ok commands=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 2: accept  (The oracle is green: tsc reports no errors and all 18 vitest tests pass. The manifest now shows a { kind: "clear" } variant in the Command union and an exported clear(todos) in commands. Both owners submitted the planned changes, including the new tests I asked for in parseArgs, clear and run. The request is satisfied.)

